# T21 spot check B23 (look-back camera against a wall): Quick Race on Toy Town, no steering: the
# car drives straight from the grid into the outer barrier of the first corner and stays nose-first
# against it; look back there (the look-back camera sits ahead of the car, i.e. in/behind the
# barrier → it must pull in, not show black). B10 is checked in keyboard_only.script's log.
wait ui
wait screen title
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Title
wait screen main
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Quick Race
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait screen trackSelect
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Toy Town (focused): select → Choose car
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # → Car select
wait screen carSelect
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # race
wait racing
hold keyboardA throttle 1
@300 shot b23_01_chase_5s
@420 shot b23_02_chase_7s
@440 hold keyboardA lookBack 1
@470 shot b23_03_look_back_7s
@520 shot b23_04_look_back_8s
@540 hold keyboardA lookBack 0
@600 shot b23_05_chase_10s
@610 hold keyboardA lookBack 1
@650 shot b23_06_look_back_10s
@660 release keyboardA
1.0 exit
